      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹19.40 (down from ₹22.26 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹740.4b (flat on FY 2025). Net income: ₹192.9b (down 13% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 26% (down from 30% in FY 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 5.1%. Earnings per share (EPS) exceeded analyst estimates by 6.5%. Revenue is expected to decline by 7.2% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, while revenues in the Banks industry in India are expected to grow by 2.9%. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
