      "body": "Kotak Mahindra Bank Limited announced that CTO Bhavnish Lathia has resigned from his role citing personal reasons. In a stock exchange filing, Kotak Mahindra Bank said its board of directors had accepted the resignation, with Lathia last working day being 9 February 2026. The Kotak Mahindra Bank Chief Technology Officer's resignation came in less than one year after his appointment in March 2025. The bank has appointed Nilesh Chaudhari as the new Chief Technology Officer. Bhavnish Lathia had been associated with Kotak Mahindra Bank since 2022. Known as Nish among his colleagues, Lathia has over 25 years of global experience across roles in different industries. In 2022, he joined Kota Mahindra Bank as the Chief of Customer Experience and Head of Technology in its Consumer Bank division, wh",
