      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.95 (vs ₹4.73 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.95 (up from ₹4.73 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹195.3b (up 24% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹49.2b (up 4.7% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 25% (down from 30% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is expected to decline by 8.4% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, while revenues in the Banks industry in India are expected to grow by 2.8%. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 10% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 7% per year.",
